## Addendum 2026-09-14-B — assignment intent and claimed subject matter

This addendum does not rewrite the locked body. It states default ownership and assignment intent for house works.

### A. Default copyright owner

The default copyright owner of house works is **Web Development Corporation, a Delaware Corporation** (also styled Web Development, Inc. or Web Development Incorporated when used as a trade style of that same corporation).

Michael Aaron Loftus is the sole owner and incorporator of Web Development Corporation. Any copyright that first vests in him in house works is intended, as of fixation, to be assigned to Web Development Corporation. If a court or office later treats a given house work as first owned by Loftus rather than by the corporation, this addendum is the record of that assignment intent. Default logical deduction for house attribution is always Web Development Corporation.

### B. What is claimed

Claimed, to the extent 17 U.S.C. allows, is the original expression fixed in house works: skill text, locked prompts, compiled PDFs, captions, selection and arrangement of research, human-directed compilation, and the human-authored synthesis written into those files.

17 U.S.C. § 102(b) does not protect ideas, procedures, processes, systems, or discoveries as such. This addendum does not pretend that an unfixed idea is a copyrighted work. It claims the fixed expression of house compilation and synthesis.

Material generated with assistance from a large language model is claimed only to the extent human authorship, selection, arrangement, or expressive revision is present in the fixed house file. A copyright notice is not a U.S. Copyright Office registration. Unassisted machine output, standing alone, is not treated here as a completed registration or as a substitute for human authorship.

### C. Living footer on house PDFs

Every PDF this house toolchain emits — folio, deep, print, atlas, corpus, article-clip, copyright restamp, and any later house builder in this environment — carries:

Copyright © 2012–YEAR Web Development Corporation. All rights reserved.

YEAR is `new Date().getFullYear()` in field `WCACopyrightYear` on open. That is the default attribute for novel house expression synthesized with artificial intelligence and fixed in those PDFs.

### D. Reach

This addendum binds project skills, locked prompts, and PDFs those skills write. It cannot rewrite Grok’s global system prompt or chats that never pass through this toolchain. Within this toolchain, the default owner line is Web Development Corporation, not a third party and not the withdrawn “Corporation A” misnomer.

<!-- WCA_HOUSE_LEGAL_ADDENDUM 2026-09-14-B -->
